 a narrow jaw. Look for a dark undercut with a longer wave on top. On an ordinary day, the familiar outfit is a black overshirt with pearl buttons with a cloth patch so neatly matched it only shows in strong light. In conversation Ellen folds a paper napkin into quarters without noticing.","personality":"Ellen carries anger into a conversation very slowly. Once it arrives, a quiet statement of facts can be considerably harder to sidestep than a shout.","agenda":"To find a training room inside the conversion.","family":"Aubrey Yates is Ellen’s stepsibling. Ellen sets the time to leave. Aubrey picks the meeting place. It lets them stay close without turning a family visit into the loss of an entire day. They have both had stretches when that distinction mattered. Asked about *The misplaced umbrella*, Aubrey says, “I manage the hotel that owns the stripes. I took the patched one to lunch and liked the shade better.”","connections":"Lars James. A desk-job ambition gets its first practical offer from a warehouse evening student.","familyIds":["AH-R0672"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1061"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A worker says their job was left out of the consultation","response":"Ellen records the missing job in the worker's own words for the consultation.","asWritten":"A worker says their job was left out of the consultation. Ellen records the missing job in the worker's own words for the consultation."},{"situation":"The last bus leaves while an elderly stranger is still crossing toward it","response":"Ellen asks the stranger who will be expecting them, then helps find a way to tell that person.","asWritten":"The last bus leaves while an elderly stranger is still crossing toward it. Ellen asks the stranger who will be expecting them, then helps find a way to tell that person."},{"situation":"If a friend asks for a false alibi for an ordinary missed appointment","response":"Ellen offers to accompany them while they tell the truth.","asWritten":"If a friend asks for a false alibi for an ordinary missed appointment, Ellen offers to accompany them while they tell the truth."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_bob01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_shirt","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_boots","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","weight_max","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_weight_max__muscle_max","corr_gender_female__muscle_max","corr_gender_female__weight_max"]},"weights":[0.5061,0.2702,0.4094,0.3237,0.4813,0.2105,0.4793,0.3706,0.0519,0.0828,0.1118,0.5342,0.306,0.3379,0.4657,0.4604,0.2806,0,0,0.11062,0.2072,0.13675],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","weight_max","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_e